    ⚡ HOW THE PROGRAM WORKS:
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    
    🔹 CORE TECHNOLOGY
    Radio Management Panel operates as a self-hosted web application with a powerful backend engine that handles audio streaming, automation, and station management. The system integrates with popular streaming servers like Icecast and SHOUTcast, providing a unified interface for controlling broadcast operations. It includes a robust scheduling engine that manages playlists, automated shows, and live broadcasts with precision timing. The panel uses a modern database system to track all station activities, listener statistics, and content libraries .
    
